														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4822867">
									

<p>I sort of assumed a good chunk of people here read it. Then again, there is a sea of canons so I guess it is hard to know anything specific. But I do recommend reading about it, not just so you can understand where my tale is coming from, but the canon itself is interesting and creative in of itself.</p>
<p>I'm glad you enjoy the idea of following one character. And having my MC have strong characterization is what I plan on. I just wanna make sure it works and doesn't fall flat.</p>
<p>I understand that you may not be familiar with Apotheosis so I can see why you're confused.</p>
<p>For your last paragraph, since I replied 3 days from now. In Apotheosis, all of humanity is given supernatural abilities by a cosmic entity. Yeah&#8230; As for the abilities, according to Apotheosis, it's basically magic. And everyone has this own unique power. For Patrick, it's to summon black holes.</p>
<p>Hopefully you were able to read Apotheosis after you read this. When you do find the time, due let me know what do you think now that you are now familiar with the canon I'm using.</p>
<p>Thank you so much for your time!</p>

